message: "If you use SARscope, cite this software by its version and repository URL. A Zenodo DOI is reserved but not yet published, and the software manuscript is in preparation."
type: software
title: "SARscope: interactive, assay-aware structure-activity interpretation"
authors:
  - family-names: Boulaamane
    given-names: Yassir
repository-code: "https://github.com/yboulaamane/sarscope"
url: "https://sarscope.streamlit.app/"
version: "0.1.0"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
abstract: "A staged browser and command-line workflow for traceable assay-aware SAR analysis, activity-cliff exploration and retrospective QSAR. Evidence grades are descriptive support heuristics, not calibrated probabilities."
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - structure-activity relationships
  - activity cliffs
  - medicinal chemistry
  - ChEMBL
